A note on why this is stricter than it may look. This repository implements
clinical safety controls — NABL scope routing, bedside sample labelling,
cold-chain custody, critical-value escalation and a human release gate. Those
controls are load-bearing. Code lifted from here and deployed without them, or
with them weakened, can produce results that look valid and are not. That risk
sits with patients, which is why reuse is by permission rather than by default.

